Error [jet.EffectWithoutAuthority]: This `#FX` region uses the effect `Net`, which it has no authority for
  --> Tests/UI/Effects/nested_grant_cannot_widen_outer_authority.jet:3:20
    |
  3 |         #FX(inner: Net) {
    |                    ^^^^
 Why: `#FX(…)` allows only `FS`; an effect reached inside — even through a call — must be in that list
 Fix: Add `Net` to the `#FX(…)` list, or move that work outside the region
 Denial: invocation
 Call chain: #FX
 Scope chain: #FX
